graph\" >Responsive controls. Dodge, dash and slash through fantastic beasts and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a dark fantasy world filled with lore, explore secrets in a non linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a whole city of your Dark Elf kin and follow numerous quests and side quests to gain unique spells, weapons, and XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path, build multiple loadouts, collect gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tons of potions, poisons, and elixirs to modify your gameplay. Find ingredients to craft your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time is respected. Minimal death penalties. Fast travel. Modernized QOL.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t=1764641273\" width=620 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/ce5f7ce6d25ff19facaee41a558c5c59.avif?t=1764641273\" width=620 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MegaQuest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/08702e08306d35ec44e20ddc0d980dc67f969d56/header.jpg?t=1764641273","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":